        "description": "Soft-delete a subject with no review history (us-01 AC8, T2.3b). Its exam, questions and\nunits stay but are hidden; the name can be used again. A subject with an attempt, a draft\nincluded, answers 409 (deleting those comes with T6.3).",
        "operationId": "delete_subject_v1_subjects__subject_id__delete",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "subject_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "format": "uuid",
              "title": "Subject Id",
              "type": "string"
